# Archsphere logbook (append-only)

When updating Archsphere projects (MCP or Integration API):

1. **Append** status notes with `append_logbook_entry` — one call per event.
2. **Never** send `logbook.entries` on `update_project` / PATCH project — it replaces the full list.
3. **Never** use `update_logbook_entry` to record new progress — only to fix a typo on an existing line.
4. After `upsert_wbs_artifact` or `upsertWbsArtifact`, call `append_logbook_entry` in a **separate** step with a one-line summary.

Full workflow: `.cursor/skills/archsphere-integration/SKILL.md` (Logbook section).
